00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:21.870
Cloud Firestore is our NoSQL
document-oriented database,

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.138
making it part of our
non-relational offering.

00:02:24.138 --> 00:02:26.180
And we'll talk about this
data model a little bit

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:29.190
later in the presentation.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:31.585
I want to take a
