00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.840
So here we've got a high level
architecture diagram of the app

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.700
that we're going to be
demoing and analyzing

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:31.070
today called Firepixels.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.830
In the little mobile
icon, you can kind of

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.960
see that there are
four colored quadrants.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:39.620
This is actually the
Firestore logo colored

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.450
using the Google colors.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.700
So each of these
respective quadrants

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:46.070
is made up of 10,000 pixels.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:48.770
And each of those
