00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:45.977
And because you were
very quick to market,

00:19:45.977 --> 00:19:48.560
that probably didn't mean that
you baked all of your analytics

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.180
into your app from the get-go.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:54.420
So how do you reinforce and
get information for your users?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.027
So the particular
business questions

00:19:57.027 --> 00:19:58.610
