OK, great.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:55.660
Over here on the left hand side,
this is the Firepixels app.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:57.130
This is a real time app.

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.980
This is running,
hitting Firestore.

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:01.990
We can see each of the four
colored quadrants currently

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:02.490
of--

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:03.010
oh, look.

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:03.510
Cool.

