00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:18.660
So that was just 10,000 writes
to the database and the events

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:21.450
being triggered, audited,
sent to the back end,

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:23.520
as well as aggregated
