00:29:48.900 --> 00:29:52.040
Function into BigQuery.

00:29:52.040 --> 00:29:54.620
So the BigQuery
node module-- we're

00:29:54.620 --> 00:29:57.560
able to just import up here the
data set that we're inserting

00:29:57.560 --> 00:29:59.900
to, the table that
