00:30:12.830 --> 00:30:15.240
is defaulted to using
the service account.

00:30:15.240 --> 00:30:17.690
So if you're running
something on Cloud Functions

00:30:17.690 --> 00:30:23.000
or you're running something
on App Engine or GCP,

00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:25.520
the environment is essentially
bootstrapped for you

00:30:25.520 --> 00:30:28.010
already to use the service
account information

00:30:28.010 --> 00:30:31.250
that you've configured
through the cloud API.

00:30:31.250 --> 00:30:35.030
So moving down a little
bit, lines 7 through 26

00:30:35.030 --> 00:30:36.752
